#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.rst:2
msgid "nanamax"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:1
msgid ""
"Compute the maximum of tensor elements along specified dimensions, "
"ignoring NaN values."
msgstr "NaN値を無視して、指定された次元に沿ってテンソル要素の最大値を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:4
msgid ""
"This function calculates the maximum of all valid (non-NaN) elements in a"
" tensor along the specified dimension(s). Unlike :func:`nanmax`, this "
"function supports multiple dimensions but does not return indices. When "
"no valid elements are found along a dimension, the result is NaN."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された次元に沿って、テンソル内のすべての有効な（NaNでない）要素の最大値を計算します。:func:`nanmax` "
"と異なり、この関数は複数の次元をサポートしますが、インデックスは返しません。次元に沿って有効な要素が1つも存在しない場合、結果はNaNとなります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:9
msgid "The NaN-aware maximum is computed as:"
msgstr "NaNを考慮した最大値は次のように計算されます:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:11
msgid ""
"\\text{nanamax}(X) = \\max_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{nanamax}(X) = \\max_{i \\text{ valid}} X_i\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:14
msgid "where the maximum is over all valid (non-NaN) values."
msgstr "ここで、最大値はすべての有効な（NaNでない）値に対して計算されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:17
msgid "The input tensor containing values."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:20
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the maximum. If None (default), "
"the maximum is computed over all dimensions."
msgstr "最大値を計算する次元（複数可）。None（デフォルト）の場合、すべての次元にわたって最大値が計算されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:24
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:28
msgid ""
"The maximum values computed only over valid (non-NaN) values. When no "
"valid values exist along a dimension, the result is NaN. The shape "
"depends on the input dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"有効な（NaNでない）値のみに対して計算された最大値。次元に沿って有効な値が存在しない場合、結果はNaNとなります。形状は入力の次元、:attr:`dim`"
" および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:35
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:37
msgid ""
">>> # Simple maximum with NaN values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x)\n"
"tensor(5.)"
msgstr ">>> # NaN値を含む単純な最大値\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, nan, 4.0, 5.0])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x)\ntensor(5.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:42
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN returns NaN\n"
">>> all_nan = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(all_nan)\n"
"tensor(nan)"
msgstr ">>> # すべてNaNの場合はNaNを返す\n>>> all_nan = torch.tensor([nan, nan, nan])\n>>> QF.nanamax(all_nan)\ntensor(nan)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:47
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensor with max along columns\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([4., 5., 3.])"
msgstr ">>> # 2次元テンソルの列方向の最大値\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=0)\ntensor([4., 5., 3.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:53
msgid ""
">>> # Max along rows\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([3., 5.])"
msgstr ">>> # 行方向の最大値\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\ntensor([3., 5.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:57
msgid ""
">>> # Multiple dimensions\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n"
"...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=(1, 2))\n"
"tensor([4., 7.])"
msgstr ">>> # 複数の次元\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, nan], [3.0, 4.0]],\n...                   [[nan, 6.0], [7.0, nan]]])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=(1, 2))\ntensor([4., 7.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:63
msgid ""
">>> # With keepdim\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[3.],\n"
"        [5.]])"
msgstr ">>> # keepdim を使用\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [4.0, 5.0, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1, keepdim=True)\ntensor([[3.],\n        [5.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:70
msgid ""
">>> # All NaN slice returns NaN\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([2., nan])"
msgstr ">>> # すべてNaNのスライスはNaNを返す\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n...                   [nan, nan]])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\ntensor([2., nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:76
msgid ""
">>> # With negative infinity\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -inf, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [nan, 2.0, -inf]])\n"
">>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([3., 2.])"
msgstr ">>> # 負の無限大を含む\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -inf, 3.0],\n...                   [nan, 2.0, -inf]])\n>>> QF.nanamax(x, dim=1)\ntensor([3., 2.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:82
msgid ":func:`nanmax`: NaN-aware maximum with indices (single dimension only)."
msgstr ":func:`nanmax`: インデックスも返すNaN対応の最大値（単一次元のみ）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:84
msgid ":func:`nanamin`: NaN-aware minimum over multiple dimensions."
msgstr ":func:`nanamin`: 複数次元に対応したNaN対応の最小値。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.nanamax.nanamax:85
msgid ""
"``torch.amax``: Standard maximum over multiple dimensions (NaN "
"propagates)."
msgstr "``torch.amax``: 複数次元に対応した標準の最大値（NaNは伝播します）。"

